for more than ten minutes at a time.

184
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,750
However,

185
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:21,661
at the top of the tree is the floating city,
and in it lives Oberon, the Fairy King.

186
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,217
The first race to reach him will be reborn

187
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:26,947
as an advanced class of
fairy known as Alves.

188
00:11:27,220 --> 00:11:29,277
And what's cool about that is they'll be

189
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,717
able to fly around for
as long as they want.

190
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,720
That is cool.

191
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,649
It'd be sweet to fly
for as long as I want.

192
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:40,477
So how does someone get to
the top of the tree at the

193
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:43,157
base of the tree there's a
big dome that's the gateway

194
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:46,277
to the floating city but
then you have to get past the

195
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:49,857
npcs that guard it and
they're super powerful they're

196
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:53,057
that strong huh let me
put it this way the game's

197
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:56,017
been around for a year now
right no one's got past them

198
00:11:56,100 --> 00:12:00,717
maybe everyone's missed that
one key quest no wait maybe

199
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:04,937
it's designed so that one
race can't reach it alone hey

200
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:08,497
you got good instincts for
now everyone seems to think

201
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,737
it's a missing quest so
they're out there looking for

202
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:13,377
it but if we have to work
together to beat it it'll

203
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:17,917
never happen why not because
it doesn't make sense why

204
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,197
would you help another race
with a quest if they're

205
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:23,177
the ones who get the reward
can you imagine anyone being

206
00:12:23,260 --> 00:12:26,897
cool with that arrangement
then getting to the top of

207
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:30,215
the tree is impossible what's
the point in even trying?

208
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:32,340
No arguments here!

209
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:35,957
Flying is pretty addictive though.

210
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:37,457
Once you get a taste for it.

211
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:41,260
You can't give it up You think
even if it takes years someday,

212
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:43,560
but I can't wait around that long!

213
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,150
Daddy

214
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:58,324
Sorry, it's just that I have to get to the
top of the world tree as soon as I can.

215
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,180
Okay, what's the rush?

216
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,800
I'm sort of looking for someone.

217
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,360
What do you mean?

218
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:09,920
No offense, but it's hard to explain.

219
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:17,760
Thank you, Leafa.

220
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:21,006
All the info you gave
me is really gonna help.

221
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:31,000
Wait, are you heading for
the World Tree right now?

222
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:34,320
Uh-huh, I need to see for myself

223
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:37,410
Alone?

224
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:38,560
That's crazy

225
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:42,217
It's really far away and
you'll have to fight a

226
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:46,020
bunch of monsters I know you
can handle yourself, but...

227
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:51,080
Hey, if you want, I can take you there.

228
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:59,317
Thanks, but we just met, and I wouldn't
feel right you coming all that way.

229
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,897
Right, then maybe you already
know how to get there.

230
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:03,857
What you gonna do about the Guardians?

231
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:06,840
Well, I'll think of
something when I get there.

232
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:09,370
Too late.

233
00:14:09,453 --> 00:14:10,420
My mind's made up.

234
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:14,370
Okay.

235
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:18,378
So, do you want to meet up tomorrow?

236
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,480
Yeah, sure.

237
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,737
Then I'll meet you here
tomorrow at 3 p .m.

238
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:22,650
sharp.

239
00:14:22,733 --> 00:14:23,769
Um, I have to log out now.

240
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,757
So when you're ready, you can log out
in one of the rooms upstairs, okay?

241
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,780
Well, see you then. Wait!

242
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,560
Thank you, Leafa.

243
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:44,810
You:

244
00:14:57,940 --> 00:15:00,440
Hey, if you want, I can take you there.

245
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:11,720
Talk about a weird guy!

246
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:18,570
Kirito...

247
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,977
I guess this means goodbye
till tomorrow, doesn't it?

248
00:15:29,060 --> 00:15:30,577
Yeah, but I'll be back soon.

249
00:15:30,660 --> 00:15:31,954
It won't be that long.

250
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:35,630
Daddy?

251
00:15:35,713 --> 00:15:38,040
Would it be alright if
I slept next to you?

252
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,220
Just until you log out?

253
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:44,860
Yeah, sure, I don't mind.

254
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:53,137
You and me, we're gonna save Asuna.

255
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:55,926
Then we'll all go buy a
house somewhere again.

256
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:58,117
That would make me so happy.

257
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:02,259
You know, living with you and Mommy
again would be a dream come true.

258
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:06,757
It's not a dream.

259
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:09,380
I promise you I'll make it a reality.

260
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,800
Good night, Daddy.

261
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:55,947
Right now, your face is more
beautiful than anything, Titania.

262
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:59,460
The way you look like you're about to cry.

263
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:03,399
I wish I could preserve it
and hang it up on a wall.

264
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:04,877
What are you waiting for?

265
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,790
Permission?

266
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:15,457
You can do whatever you want.

267
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,977
I have no say in the matter.

268
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:19,119
You're the system admin, after all.

269
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,797
Such cold words from such a pretty mouth.

270
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:26,115
Now, have I ever laid a hand on you
when you didn't want me to, Titania?

271
00:17:27,260 --> 00:17:29,377
Stop calling me by that stupid name.

272
00:17:29,460 --> 00:17:31,020
My name is Asuna. Sugo.

273
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,420
You're spoiling the fun.

274
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:37,601
In this world, I'm known
as Oberon the Fairy King.

275
00:17:37,940 --> 00:17:41,757
There's not a player who wouldn't give
everything to be the ruler of Alfheim.

276
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:45,060
And you are Queen Titania,
my breathtaking bride.

277
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:47,107
What more could you ask for?

278
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:52,440
So, as my queen, as my bride, when
will you give your heart to me?

279
00:17:53,220 --> 00:17:54,050
Never.

280
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:58,137
The only things I'll give you are
disgust and hatred, and nothing more.

281
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:00,497
You're a stubborn girl,
I'll give you that.

282
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:05,280
But you know, for a while
now I've been thinking.

283
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:12,520
Romance is nice and all, but it might
be more fun if I just took you by force.

284
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,960
Stop it!

285
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:45,640
Of course, my dear. It was a joke.

286
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:48,096
I'd never really force myself on you.

287
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:49,580
I don't have to.

288
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:53,240
You'll start wanting me
soon enough, I promise.

289
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:55,080
You're insane.

290
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:59,145
You won't be talking like
that for much longer.

291
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:06,720
Right now, in this world, Tens of thousands
of players are enjoying this game.

292
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:11,680
But none of them have a clue about the
true potential of the full-dive system.

293
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:16,311
Did you know that by expanding
the brain's control regions,

294
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:20,580
one could influence a person's
thoughts, emotions, and memories?

295
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:22,720
You can't!

296
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:24,757
Technology like that is illegal!

297
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:26,100
Oh, but you're wrong.

298
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:30,240
In fact, several countries are
researching it as we speak.

299
00:19:30,780 --> 00:19:34,900
The only thing standing in the way
is finding people to experiment on.

300
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:38,732
But one day, I was watching
the news, and there they were.

301
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:42,080
Ten thousand ideal guinea pigs!

302
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,710
Mr.

303
00:19:45,793 --> 00:19:48,220
Kayaba was a genius,
but he was also a fool.

304
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:51,780
All he wanted to use his
technology for was his game.

305
00:19:52,100 --> 00:19:54,218
He couldn't see the potential in it.

306
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:55,440
But I did.

307
00:19:55,660 --> 00:19:57,717
It wasn't too difficult
to adjust the routers.

308
00:19:57,800 --> 00:20:01,937
The minute SAO's players were logged
out, I just grabbed a few from the flow.

309
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:05,900
Just like that, I had 300 of
my very own test subjects.

310
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:09,900
My research has taken great
strides the past two months.

311
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,817
I've been developing a
technology that seeds memories

312
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:15,606
with objects and uses
them to control emotion.

313
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:18,000
My work is almost finished now.

314
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,720
You are crazy.

315
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,941
My father would never allow
that kind of research.

316
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:28,637
He wouldn't if he knew about it,

317
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:31,297
but it's being done in secret—just
a small team and myself.

318
00:20:31,380 --> 00:20:32,210
Otherwise,

319
00:20:32,293 --> 00:20:36,617
I wouldn't be able to sell it off
to who an American corporation

320
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:40,497
you won't believe how anxious
they are to get their hands on it,

321
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:44,437
and soon I'm going to sell it and
wreck to them for as much as I can.

322
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:50,257
That won't happen; I'll see to that as
soon as I get back to the real world.

323
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:53,752
world The first thing I'll do
is report you to the police.

324
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:56,840
You want to bet?

325
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,922
You're in the same boat
as the other guinea pigs.

326
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:01,997
What, you haven't figured it out?

327
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:04,786
If I wanted, I could
alter your memories, too.

328
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:14,980
I'm on the way.

329
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:16,458
Wait for my orders.

330
00:21:17,740 --> 00:21:18,570
Don't worry.

331
00:21:18,653 --> 00:21:22,579
The last thing I'd ever want to do
is turn you into a porcelain doll.

332
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:25,937
But the next time we
meet, I hope you'll be...

333
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:28,380
just a bit more submissive.

334
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:30,770
Titania.

335
00:21:46,380 --> 00:21:47,500
Farewell, my love.

336
00:22:00,740 --> 00:22:03,500
Kirito, please save me.

337
00:22:21,460 --> 00:22:23,120
I love you.

338
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:09,077
Thank

339
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:10,477
you

340
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:17,560
so

341
00:23:18,500 --> 00:23:19,559
much for watching.
